msgstr "透過率"

#: includes/admin/pages/class-extend-settings-page.php:558
msgid "The farther left you slide, the more transparent the image becomes."
msgstr "左にスライドするほど透明度が高くなります。"

#: includes/admin/pages/class-extend-settings-page.php:564
msgid "DOM to make transparent"
msgstr "透過させるDOM"

#: includes/admin/pages/class-extend-settings-page.php:571
msgid "Enter the DOM elements you want to make transparent."
msgstr "透過させたいDOM要素を入力してください。"

